Quick Reference: Common Tasks
===============================================================================

Add a new site:
1. Sites -> Add Site (name, user, pass, host:port)
2. Site detail -> Add sections (ISOGAMES -> /GAMES/, MP3 -> /MP3/)
3. Rules -> Add rules for new site
4. Routes -> Add routes (new site <-> existing sites)

Add a new IRC channel:
1. IRC -> Channels -> Add Channel
2. Set channel roles (ADMIN, STATS, ADDPRE, etc.)
3. Add precatcher entries (bot nick, event, words)
4. Test with Precatcher test tool

Modify rules:
1. Rules page -> Find site/section
2. Edit or delete existing rules
3. Add new rules (remember order matters!)
4. Test with Rules test tool

Check why release was dropped:
1. Logs page -> Search for release name
2. Check rule evaluation messages
3. Check "No route" or "No section" errors
4. Use Rules test tool to simulate evaluation

